  "brain_first": "“别逐词等“标准发音”；先听重读词、数字、否定和转折。”",
  "sort_order": 1003,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "你看得懂 transcript，但录音里 want to / did",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "you / next day / could you 连在一起就反应不过",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "来；或态度题总听不出语气。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Connected speech / stress / intonation：真实语",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "流会出现连读、弱读、失去爆破、重音与语调变",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "化。高考不要求你标音标理论，但会利用这些现象",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "传递信息。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “别逐词等“标准发音”；先听重读词、数字、否定和转折。”",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 英语口语不是把字典里的单词一个个分开念。掌握最常见的语流变化，能直接减少",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“单词明明认识却没听见”的失分。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6. 1 先把题干决定的关键词类型想清楚：数字 / 行为 / 态度 / 原因。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "7. 2 录音中优先抓重读实词：名词、主要动词、形容词、数字；弱读的冠词/介词没听全不影响先抓主干。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "8. 3 遇到 not, never, hardly, but, actually 等改变方向的词，立刻更新判断。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9. 4 数字和时间注意 -teen / -ty, fifteen / fifty, thirteen / thirty 的区别；结合单位和上下文确认。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "10. 5 态度题同时听词义和语调：同一句 Really? 上扬可能是追问，下落可能是确认/质疑，最终以完整上下文为",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "准。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If 两个词中间前词以辅音结尾、后词以元音开头 → 可能连读，别强求边界。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If 一个爆破音后面又跟辅音 → 前一个可能“没完全爆出来”，不要误以为单词消失。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If 功能词听得很轻 → 先抓重读内容词，再用语法补关系。",
      "sourcePage": 5,
      "sourceIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 你已经抓住题目真正需要的核心信息，并且后文没有转折修正。",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不要试图把整段录音在脑中逐字回放。只复盘：重读词是什么？有没有否定/",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "转折？最后决定是什么？",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Could you send it again? 在自然语流里不会四个词都同样清楚。即使 could you 听得弱，只要抓到",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "send / again，结合题干仍可判断“请求重发”。",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "把“没听清某个小词”误判成整题不会；只听原词，不接受同义改写；忽略否定词和重音造成的意思变化。",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我是否抓到了重读核心词？否定/转折有没有漏？数字单位是否匹配？",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 先抓重读词和方向词；小词听不全，不等于整句听不懂。",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 听到“Did you eat yet?”时，不能清楚分开每个词。第一步应该做什么？",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. “fifteen”与“fifty”纠结时还可以用什么确认？",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 听到 but 后最重要的动作是什么？",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 功能词 a/to/of 听得很弱，是否必须全部听清才能做题？",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 态度题只凭语调能不能定答案？",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 抓重读内容词 eat / yet 和题干需求，不强求逐词边界。；2. 单位、上下文和重音/尾音共同确认。；3.",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "更新前面的判断，重新记录转折后信息。；4. 不一定；先抓重读实词和逻辑方向。；5. 不能；语调+评价词+上下文",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "一起判断。",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L0 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L0”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 6,
      "sourceIndex": 159
    }
  ],
